{"seq":9,"slug":"incremental-parsing","title":"增量解析与 Tree-sitter","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 增量解析与 Tree-sitter\n\n每次你在编辑器里敲下一个字符，背后都有一台解析器在和时间赛跑。它必须在你按下下一个键之前，把这一行字符重新理解成一棵语法树，否则语法高亮会闪烁、自动缩进会错位、跳转定义会指向旧位置。传统编译器的解析器为「把整个文件读一遍、报错就停」而设计，它们既不在乎毫秒级延迟，也无法容忍残缺的、写到一半的代码。编辑器需要的是另一种解析器：能复用上一次的成果、只重算被改动的局部、面对语法错误也能继续工作。这正是增量解析要解决的问题，而 Tree-sitter 是这套思想在 2026 年最广为部署的工程实现。\n\n本 hub 用四章把这条线索从原理走到落地，层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基：先讲清编辑器对解析有哪些区别于批处理编译器的硬性需求（低延迟、容错、可中断），再引出增量解析的核心理念——把一次编辑看成对旧语法树的局部修补而非推倒重来，最后单独剖析「错误恢复」这个编辑器场景独有的难题。没有这三块地基，后面的算法会显得像凭空发明。\n\n第二章「算法」回答「怎么做到」：Wagner 与 Graham 的句型增量 LR 算法是现代增量解析的理论原点，我们详解它如何在最优时间内吸收任意多处编辑；接着把「语法树复用」单独拆出来讲——哪些子树能原样搬过来、状态匹配的判定条件是什么；再用一章讲 GLR/GLL 这类广义解析与歧义处理，解释为什么 Tree-sitter 选择了 GLR 而非传统 LR。\n\n第三章「Tree-sitter」把抽象算法落到一个真实系统：先看它的整体架构（扫描器、解析表、C 运行时、增量更新接口），再讲如何用 `grammar.js` 这套 DSL 编写文法、处理优先级与冲突，最后讲它独有的 S 表达式查询语言——这是 Tree-sitter 区别于其它解析库的关键设计，把「语法树怎么用」也变成了声明式规则。\n\n第四章「应用」收口：语法高亮、代码导航与结构（折叠、符号、结构化选择）、以及编辑器集成本身（Neovim、Zed、Helix 如何接入）。这一章让前三章的原理变成你每天在屏幕上看到的东西。\n\n四条主线——需求、算法、引擎、应用——首尾相扣。读完你应当既能解释 Tree-sitter「为什么快、为什么不怕错」，也能动手为一门新语言写文法、写查询，并把它接进一个编辑器。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parsing-in-editors","title":"编辑器中的解析需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/foundations/parsing-in-editors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"incremental-concept","title":"增量解析的理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/foundations/incremental-concept"},{"seq":3,"slug":"error-recovery","title":"错误恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/foundations/error-recovery"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"incremental-algorithms","title":"增量解析算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/algorithms/incremental-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-reuse","title":"语法树复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/algorithms/tree-reuse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gll-glr","title":"GLL/GLR 与歧义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/algorithms/gll-glr"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"treesitter","title":"Tree-sitter 引擎","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/treesitter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tree-sitter-architecture","title":"Tree-sitter 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/treesitter/tree-sitter-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"writing-grammars","title":"文法编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/treesitter/writing-grammars"},{"seq":3,"slug":"queries-highlighting","title":"查询与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/treesitter/queries-highlighting"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"syntax-highlighting","title":"语法高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/applications/syntax-highlighting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-navigation","title":"代码导航与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/applications/code-navigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"editor-integration","title":"编辑器集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/incremental-parsing/applications/editor-integration"}]}]}